```bash
# Unit tests
npm run test
npm run test:watch
npm run test:coverage

# E2E tests
npx playwright test
npx playwright test --headed
npx playwright test --debug

# Python tests
cd apps/calc-engine
pytest
pytest --cov=app
```

**Coverage требования:**
- Backend: 90%+
- Frontend: 80%+
- Python: 90%+

